      "answer": "The paper used the News Category Dataset, a collection of HuffPost headlines published between 2012 and 2018 and obtained from Kaggle. The full dataset contains 200k headlines, but the analysis used a sample of roughly 33k headlines spanning 23 categories [1].",
      "insufficient": false,
      "citations": [
